li>slider: yes / no</li>\n<li>autoplay: true / false</li>\n<li>delay: e.g., 3000 (milliseconds)</li>\n<li>loop: true / false</li>\n<li>dots: true / false</li>\n</ul>\n<p>For Pro Version  : <a href=\"https://buffercode.com/plugin/random-banner-pro\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Random Banner Pro Support</a></p>\n",
